⚡ 2. Electrical Engineering in OT (MOST IMPORTANT)

This is the core of OT industry

Where EE is used:
power generation (thermal, hydro, nuclear)
transmission & distribution grids
substations
smart meters
SCADA systems
PLC control systems
Protocols used:
IEC 61850 (substations)
DNP3 (power systems)
Modbus (industrial control)
🧠 Role in OT cybersecurity:

Electrical systems define:

what data means (voltage, current, frequency)
what “danger” means (grid failure, blackout)
EE = defines physical truth of OT systems
Cybersecurity = protects control of that truth

👉 So YES: EE is the backbone of OT cybersecurity

